# NAME: Spotify (Kiki Stable Routing)
# AUTHOR: kiki
# UPDATED: 2026-11-12
# FORMAT: Loon Remote Rule (.list) - select policy in Loon, do not add policy here.
# GOAL: Keep Spotify control, login, playback and audio CDN on the SAME policy.
# SOURCES: blackmatrix7, Repcz, LM-Firefly, Spotify Community reports.
# NOTICE: This file only routes traffic. It does NOT block ads or unlock Premium.
# Do not combine with another Spotify.list; configure this subscription above broad DIRECT/REJECT rules.
# Suggested policy: a stable manual proxy node/group; avoid per-request switching during diagnosis.

# 1) Spotify API, login, account, images, downloads and playback (spclient, dealer, apresolve).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotify.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotifycdn.net

# 2) Main audio/image/video CDNs (incl. audio4-fa.scdn.co, audio4-gm-fb.spotifycdn.com).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,scdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pscdn.co

# 3) Akamai / Fastly audio and video edges; include names beyond spotify.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio4-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads4-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,spotify.com.edgesuite.net
DOMAIN,spotify.map.fastly.net
DOMAIN,spotify.map.fastlylb.net

# 4) Short links and adjacent Spotify services.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spoti.fi
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotify.app.link
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byspotify.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotify-everywhere.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotilocal.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tospotify.com
DOMAIN,cdn-spotify-experiments.conductrics.com

# 5) Catch newly introduced Spotify-branded hostnames, incl. CDN subdomains.
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,spotify

# Deliberately omitted:
# - IP-CIDR: fixed Cloud/shared IPs can change or route unrelated traffic.
# - PROCESS-NAME: ignored by Loon on iOS.
# - USER-AGENT: does not cover every non-HTTP audio connection.
# - REJECT: ad blocking is handled separately by spotify.plugin.
